# 唯一手工联调入口。逐条执行，不要对真实数据使用“运行全部”。
# 在 http-client.private.env.json 中填写变量，凭据与响应不提交。
# accessToken 为管理账号令牌，targetToken 为被授权用户令牌；登录响应中复制令牌。
# ID 与 expectedVersion 均取自当前查询响应，禁止照抄历史编号。
# appCode=IAM 用于演示平台自身；平台应用禁止停用。
# HR/OA 请求需要已登记服务身份和对实际请求字节生成的新时间戳、nonce、签名。
# 此集合是手工示例；完整异常、回滚、并发验证在 src/test 中。
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@appCode = IAM

### 连通性：GET /system/ping
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/ping
X-Request-Id: local-ping-001

### 连通性：GET /system/database
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/database

### 登录与鉴权：POST /auth/login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginType":"USERNAME","identifier":"{{username}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### 登录与鉴权：POST /auth/sms/send
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/sms/send
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"{{phone}}","purpose":"SET_PASSWORD"}

### 登录与鉴权：POST /auth/password/initialize
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password/initialize
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"{{phone}}","code":"{{setPasswordCode}}","newPassword":"{{newPassword}}"}

### 登录与鉴权：POST /auth/password/reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"{{phone}}","code":"{{resetPasswordCode}}","newPassword":"{{newPassword}}"}

### 登录与鉴权：POST /auth/logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 登录与鉴权：GET /auth/menus?appCode={{appCode}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/menus?appCode={{appCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{targetToken}}

### 登录与鉴权：POST /auth/check
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/check
Authorization: Bearer {{targetToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"httpMethod":"GET","routeTemplate":"{{routeTemplate}}"}

### 账号与授权：GET /users?keyword={{keyword}}&page=1&pageSize=20
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?keyword={{keyword}}&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 账号与授权：GET /users/{{userId}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 账号与授权：POST /users/temporary
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/temporary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"realName":"{{realName}}","phone":"{{phone}}","deptId":"{{deptId}}","reason":"temporary support"}

### 账号与授权：PATCH /users/{{userId}}/status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":2,"reason":"temporary account paused"}

### 账号与授权：GET /users/{{userId}}/roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 账号与授权：GET /users/{{userId}}/roles/{{roleId}}/sources
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/roles/{{roleId}}/sources
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 组织：GET /departments?includeDescendants=true
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments?includeDescendants=true
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

### 组织：GET /departments/{{deptId}}/users?includeDescendants=true&page=1&pageSize=20
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/{{deptId}}/users?includeDescendants=true&page=1&pageSize=20
